RelayDeck
=========

RelayDeck is an independent, self-contained project.

* It ships its own backend (server/) written from scratch in Node.
* It contains no third-party content-tool source code, front-end assets, icons,
  text, or design files.
* It does not bundle, install, launch, or require any other content workbench.
* Platform integrations are implemented by this project directly against the
  platforms' own public web interfaces, using the credentials of the user's own
  accounts.

